			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance submodules — Formatting pass and Sky build hardening\n\nUpdate nine element submodules to apply consistent code formatting and strengthen the Sky build pipeline:\n\n**Cache** (style): Format debug log macro arguments for readability. Break multi-line log! calls into separate lines per argument with blank lines after target parameters.\n\n**Cocoon** (style): Consolidate formatting across ESBuild configs and TypeScript source. Standardize blank lines after imports, object property spacing, and closing bracket placement.\n\n**Grove** (style): Apply consistent blank line formatting across 15 source files in API, Build, DevLog, Host, Protocol, Transport, WASM, and main.rs.\n\n**Mist** (docs): Remove `Air` from DNS resolver consumers in Architecture.md and DeepDive.md. Air no longer directly consumes LandDnsResolver; network isolation now covers Cocoon and Air via explicit allowlisting. Add blank lines in ForwardSecurity.rs, Resolver.rs, and WebSocket.rs.\n\n**Output** (style): Normalize whitespace across 150+ build pipeline and polyfill source files. Insert blank lines between imports, variable bindings, function definitions, and control-flow blocks.\n\n**Rest** (style): Normalize whitespace in OXC/SWC compilation modules, worker bootstrap injection, binary command parsing, and unit test fixtures.\n\n**SideCar** (chore): Add blank line before DNS result order override in dns-override.js.\n\n**Sky** (build): Extract bridge handlers into modular installers (Commands, EditorOperations, Scm, Webview) with idempotent install guards and standardized error-surrounding try/catch blocks. Strengthen build pipeline: BakeExtensionManifest now scans ~/.land/extensions, ~/.fiddee/extensions, ~/.vscode/extensions with NLS-resolution fallback. CompressBundle applies brotli compression (quality 11) to _astro and Static/Application artifacts. Harden astro.config.ts with Vite define backfills, performance-mark checkpoints, and robust extension auto-install logging.\n\n**Vine** (style): Add blank lines after match arms and inline declarations in generated protobuf runtime and notification handlers (OutputChannelCoalesce, RegisterCommand, SetTextEditorDecorations, UpdateScmGroup, WebviewLifecycle).\n\nAll changes are cosmetic or build improvements with no functional behavior changes, except Sky's enhanced build pipeline and documentation updates in Mist.",
